  "id": "USN-9207-1",
  "summary": "bcel vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Apache Commons BCEL incorrectly cached classes under\ntheir self-declared names without validating them against the requested\nname. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause BCEL to return or\nverify a different class than the one requested.",
